{"id": "34204", "title": "七月情火(黑寡妇2)", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 41, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34204/34204s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34204.htm", "intro": "那年七月他们萌发情愫,一直折磨彼此到现在……当年他带女人回家睡她的床,这笔帐她还没跟他算，现在要她帮他宣传他制作的新戏？好呀！她就「知无不言」,让他对她感「念」在心……吼～～在电话中跟她针锋相对,再故意制造不期而遇的机会。追讨不回他送的定情信物,就要求进驻她的香闺。搞什么！是他说不再纠缠的,怎么现下像颗牛皮糖？可以,他若硬要和她同居,她就让他「宾至如归」…… \r\n　　「他是一个到处留情且花心的风流男子。」这是哪种宣传手法？他非揪出这个「广播电台」不可！是她！想不到这次「跨海寻人」的任务这么快就成功，「我可不记得我欠你什么！」她是「黑寡妇」啊？吃干抹净便脚底抹油走人，既然如此,别怪他翻旧帐了！……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34204", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2173149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2173150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2173151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2173152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2173153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2173154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2173155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2173156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2173157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2173158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2173159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2173160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2173161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2173162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2173163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2173164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2173165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2173166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2173167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2173168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2173169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2173170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2173171.htm